                        :employsSignifier :SubliminalButterflyVideo ;
                        :hasPerformativeAction :Posting_SubliminalVideo ;
                        :resolvesIntoAffect :RomanticAttraction ;
                        :transformedVia :ButterflyGod ;
                        :triggeredBy :MundanePressure_RomanticAnxiety ;
                        rdfs:comment "A cyber-ritual case where a user engages with a subliminal butterfly video on Bilibili to attract high-quality romantic relationships."@en ;
                        rdfs:label "Subliminal Romance Case"@en .


###  http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/cyberwishing/cw.owl#Case_TikTokLoveManifestation
:Case_TikTokLoveManifestation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
